  <div class="key-takeaway">
    <h4>✦ Key Takeaways</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Print-based debugging: simple, effective for small bugs</li>
      <li>pdb (Python debugger): step through code interactively</li>
      <li>Assertions: verify assumptions and fail fast</li>
      <li>Combine tools: print for quick checks, pdb for complex issues</li>
    </ul>
